name: sim.setObjectHierarchyOrder
description: Moves an object up or down among its siblings in the scene hierarchy
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectHierarchyOrder(int objectHandle, int order)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectHierarchyOrder(int objectHandle, int order)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: the handle of the object
2. order: the desired zero-based position
outputs:
